{"version":1,"content":"<p>在IG及抖音擁有百萬粉絲的大陸同志KOL「Berlinsun」，與外籍伴侶以觀光名義赴台舉辦粉絲見面會，被指在社媒宣傳影射代孕等輔助生育資訊。</p><p>高雄市衛生局昨（22日）稱，其涉及發布違法醫療廣告，罰款20萬元新台幣（約4.8萬港元）；</p><p>移民署當晚將兩人驅逐出境。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:49.018480+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:54:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:18:10.551022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.767346+00:00","content_hash":"3b50bb64f769723bde287268bbd173fad1f1960a85bafced2ebb197fb6fa52d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}